//! The `transform` [CSS](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS) property lets you rotate,
//! scale, skew, or translate an element. It modifies the coordinate space of the CSS [visual
//! formatting
//! model](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/Guides/Display/Visual_formatting_model).
//!
//! Initial: none. Inherited: no.
//! Percentages: refer to the size of bounding box.
//!
//! Grammar: none | <transform-list>
//!
//! Specification: https://drafts.csswg.org/css-transforms-1/#propdef-transform
//!
//! Author guide: https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/Reference/Properties/transform
